    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what \"peace\" is there in this? it's not just about being sad. it's like the core of me is gone. the athlete, the dancer... that was the only version of me that mattered. everything else is just... maintenance. just staying alive to keep this broken body moving from one day to the next. it feels so pointless.",
